<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom bought back on Monday at NZ$7.28.</title>
<headline>Telecom bought back on Monday at NZ$7.28.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand said on Tuesday it had acquired just over 250,000 shares off market on Monday at NZ$7.28 pursuant to its NZ$1 billion share buyback programme.</p>
<p>On market it bought a similar number of shares at a range of prices between NZ$7.25 and $7.31.</p>
<p>The current phase of Telecom's buyback is expected to continue until the company gives notice that it is completed.</p>
<p>--Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
</text>
